{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38636","headline":"秋夕寓居精舍书事 · 卢汝弼","name":"秋夕寓居精舍书事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"叶满苔堦杵满城，此中多恨恨难平。\n疎檐看织蠨蛸网，暗隙愁听蟋蟀声。\n醉卧欲抛羁客思，梦归偏动故乡情。\n觉来独步长廊下，半夜西风吹月明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢汝弼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38636.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38636","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗鼓吹》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鼔吹_(四庫全書本)）"}